      "cooked": "<p>I was thinking about making a deck of Player Achievements. Something that a player will try to convince other members on his team to do. They could be very general or character specific. For example, convince Team Leader Tachy to use Research Grant instead of her base power, convince someone not to destroy one of Voss’s ships if they could, etc. I was wondering what other ideas people can come up with.</p>",
